            "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The plot.</h2>An egocentric businessman is desperate to save his company from collapse. However, he is forced to save the whole city from an impending disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603680/extras/43301c4270a1c075060ec83741aa5b8c.poster.avif?t=1792480804\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603680/extras/43301c4270a1c075060ec83741aa5b8c.webm?t=1792480804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603680/extras/43301c4270a1c075060ec83741aa5b8c.mp4?t=1792480804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every game character is a puzzle itself that can be solved or broken, so there are two ways to follow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evil (the easy way).</h2>You can steal things you need. You can trick characters you meet. You make no friends, but still advance the story and achieve to the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good (the hard way).</h2>You can do things the right way. You can help other characters to solve their own problems. You can support people and by doing so achieve the goal.<br><br>All the game characters you dealt with will meet you at the end of the game. The way you have been behaving throughout the game and decisions you made will affect the ending of the game.<br><br>The game has several completely different endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic point-and-click gameplay, featuring both pointing and clicking.<br></li><li>A variety of wacky puzzles.<br></li><li>Over 2000 lines of written dialog.<br></li><li>Interactive quirky characters each with own unique story.<br></li><li>Unique and peculiar hand drawn 2D Art-Style and 2D animation.<br></li><li>Original soundtrack.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The plot.</h2>An egocentric businessman is desperate to save his company from collapse. However, he is forced to save the whole city from an impending disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603680/extras/43301c4270a1c075060ec83741aa5b8c.poster.avif?t=1792480804\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603680/extras/43301c4270a1c075060ec83741aa5b8c.webm?t=1792480804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/603680/extras/43301c4270a1c075060ec83741aa5b8c.mp4?t=1792480804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every game character is a puzzle itself that can be solved or broken, so there are two ways to follow.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evil (the easy way).</h2>You can steal things you need. You can trick characters you meet. You make no friends, but still advance the story and achieve to the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good (the hard way).</h2>You can do things the right way. You can help other characters to solve their own problems. You can support people and by doing so achieve the goal.<br><br>All the game characters you dealt with will meet you at the end of the game. The way you have been behaving throughout the game and decisions you made will affect the ending of the game.<br><br>The game has several completely different endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic point-and-click gameplay, featuring both pointing and clicking.<br></li><li>A variety of wacky puzzles.<br></li><li>Over 2000 lines of written dialog.<br></li><li>Interactive quirky characters each with own unique story.<br></li><li>Unique and peculiar hand drawn 2D Art-Style and 2D animation.<br></li><li>Original soundtrack.</li></ul>",
